'''Items''' collects every purchasable Deadlock item, one page each. Each item page shows live stats — tier, slot, souls cost, and effects — pulled from deadlock-api.com via the <code><nowiki><deadlockitem></nowiki></code> tag, so they stay current across patches.

Items on a build page ([[:Category:Builds|builds]]) link here when you click their icon.

